usage: finalize_audit_request_v1.py [-h] --dossier DOSSIER --dossier-sha256
                                    DOSSIER_SHA256 --out OUT

Close a supplied-run offline dossier into the canonical screening audit. No
target execution or source reads. A PASS refers to retained screening evidence
only. It does not make UNKNOWN cases eligible and cannot establish G2–G6.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dossier DOSSIER
  --dossier-sha256 DOSSIER_SHA256
  --out OUT
